<title>JAPAN: Moody's, S&amp;P assign ratings to JR East Eurobonds.</title>
<headline>Moody's, S&amp;P assign ratings to JR East Eurobonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service Inc said on Thursday that it had assigned its Aa2 rating to East Japan Railway Co's 7.25-percent Eurodollar bonds due October 2006.</p>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said it had assigned its AA rating to the same bonds.</p>
</text>
